sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant D as Workload Driver
    participant S as Simulator (State Manager)
    participant SCH as Scheduler (Brain)
    participant E as Enforcer (Hands)
    participant K8S as K8s Cluster (Kind+KWOK)

    Note over D, S: 1. Workload Injection
    D->>S: Inject Workload (Job-A, 4 GPUs)
    S->>S: Add Job-A to PendingQueue
    S->>S: Increment State Version (v1 -> v2)

    Note over S, SCH: 2. Decision Loop
    loop Polling
        SCH->>S: GET /v1/state (If-None-Match: "v1")
        alt No Change
            S-->>SCH: 304 Not Modified
        else New State
            S-->>SCH: 200 OK (State v2, Pending: [Job-A])
        end
    end

    SCH->>SCH: Algorithm Logic (Random/Greedy)<br/>"Select Cluster-1 for Job-A"

    Note over SCH, E: 3. Submission & Enforcement
    SCH->>S: POST /v1/placement (Decision: Job-A -> Cluster-1)
    S->>E: Validate & Enforce(Decision)
    
    rect rgb(240, 240, 240)
        Note right of E: Enforcer Logic
        E->>E: Check Version (v2 == v2?)
        E->>E: Convert Job-A to K8s Deployment
        E->>K8S: Create Deployment (Cluster-1)
        K8S-->>E: 201 Created
        E->>S: Remove Job-A from PendingQueue
    end

    S-->>SCH: 202 Accepted (Applied)

    Note over K8S, S: 4. State Convergence
    K8S->>K8S: Scheduler (default) binds Pod -> Node
    S->>S: Watch(Pod Created)
    S->>S: Update Cluster-1 Usage (+4 GPUs)
    S->>S: Increment State Version (v2 -> v3)